{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Catgirl. In this RPG, you control a cat whose dog gets kidnapped by an evil demon queen. Now you must rescue your best friend... and maybe some other ppl too.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story focused game play (but you can body slam absent fathers too).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short &amp; sweet, just a couple hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming original art and soundtrack..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idiot-rich story with an emphasis on humor and pain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by 3 people, that's over 2 brains worth of game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be friends with an orange doggy named Mopmop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can make beats with a caveman.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u732b\u5a18</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a really handsome guy in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes i can't help but feel like a failure, no matter how hard i try</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super fun epic adventure filled with fantasy and friends!!!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569430?t=1750114941","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569430?t=1750114941","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569430/735653b3acd9b7a27021721f51ac85fbc0cf3d8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750114941","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569430/735653b3acd9b7a27021721f51ac85fbc0cf3d8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750114941","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome 